   |--------------|          |                | ptrdiff_count_( ptr )       |
   | _Ret_        |          |                |                             |
   | _Deref_ret_  |          |                |                             |
   |--------------|          |                |                             |
   | _Pre_        |          |                |                             |
   | _Post_       |          |                |                             |
   | _Deref_pre_  |          |                |                             |
   | _Deref_post_ |          |                |                             |
   |--------------|----------|----------------|-----------------------------|

