   |------|---------------|---------------|
   | Unit | Writ/Readable | Argument Type |
   |------|---------------|---------------|
   |  <>  | cap_          | <>            |
   | byte | count_        | c_            |
   |      |               | x_            |
   |------|---------------|---------------|

